WEBVTT

00:00:01.560 --> 00:00:03.560
<i>As long as good exists in this world,</i>

00:00:03.560 --> 00:00:05.720
<i>so, too, shall evil thrive.</i>

00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:08.730
<b>Narrator</b>

00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:08.730
<b>Daisuke Ban</b>

00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:09.100
<i>But behind this eternal 
clash of good and evil,</i>

00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:12.480
<i>there is another battle that goes unseen.</i>

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:18.570
Excuse me, Executive.

00:00:18.570 --> 00:00:19.810
I'd like some tea.

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:20.580
Yes, ma'am!

00:00:23.260 --> 00:00:25.810
Executive, do we have any 
sweets to go with this?

00:00:25.810 --> 00:00:26.620
Yes, ma'am!

00:00:29.420 --> 00:00:32.820
Shall I rub your shoulders, 
Great Leader of Akashic?

00:00:32.820 --> 00:00:35.500
How considerate of you, Executive!

00:00:38.510 --> 00:00:40.010
Absolute Zero Chief of Staff Megistus

00:00:38.510 --> 00:00:40.010
Incoming

00:00:40.590 --> 00:00:41.770
Speaking.

00:00:41.770 --> 00:00:44.690
<i>Great Leader, the time draws nigh.</i>

00:00:44.690 --> 00:00:46.760
Understood. I'm on my way.

00:00:49.160 --> 00:00:50.730
I've got a bit of work to do.

00:00:50.730 --> 00:00:52.270
We'll finish this later.

00:00:52.270 --> 00:00:53.290
Yes, ma'am!

00:00:57.320 --> 00:00:58.840
Miss Matsuyama...

00:00:58.840 --> 00:01:00.970
Is this executive stuff...

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:02.830
Mizuki, honey...

00:01:03.830 --> 00:01:05.780
Don't think about it too hard!

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:08.960
<b>Celebrate - Executive Promotion
Karen Mizuki</b>

00:01:08.960 --> 00:01:11.960
<b>Episode 12

00:01:15.190 --> 00:01:16.370
<i>Wolfie boy!</i>

00:01:17.470 --> 00:01:21.850
<b>Secret Society Agastia Monster Development Department
New Assistant:  Wolf Bete</b>

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:21.860
I ain't gonna hold out 
much longer like this.

00:01:21.850 --> 00:01:25.350
<b>Secret Society: Agastia Monster Development Department
{}Doctor:  Hajime Sadamaki</b>

00:01:21.850 --> 00:01:25.350
<b>Secret Society: Agastia Monster Development Department
Assistant: Touka Kuroitsu</b>

00:01:21.860 --> 00:01:23.900
This is so weird.

00:01:23.900 --> 00:01:26.230
I'm sure the principle is correct...

00:01:26.690 --> 00:01:30.220
Yeah, we were all pretty excited 
when we first heard the idea.

00:01:30.220 --> 00:01:34.190
I think that this monster concept, 
based on all the data we've collected so far,

00:01:34.190 --> 00:01:36.370
is a very interesting one.

00:01:36.560 --> 00:01:40.350
But it's going to take a pretty long 
time to finish it at our lab's scale.

00:01:40.620 --> 00:01:44.340
Huh? How many times are you 
gonna blow me up here?

00:01:45.630 --> 00:01:48.500
If only we had a little more funding...

00:01:49.040 --> 00:01:51.610
You might be getting more soon.

00:01:51.920 --> 00:01:55.130
<b>Pluripotent Cellular Executive
Immortal Camula</b>

00:01:51.980 --> 00:01:53.320
Lady Camula?

00:01:53.700 --> 00:01:58.010
However... things might also 
get a little more complicated.

00:01:58.320 --> 00:01:59.870
What do you mean by that?

00:01:59.870 --> 00:02:04.130
I've only heard the rumors, myself, but...

00:02:04.360 --> 00:02:08.070
What?! Agastia's getting bought 
out by a foreign investor?!

00:02:10.390 --> 00:02:15.730
<i>If you were to join our 
Secret Society: Zet Arc group,</i>

00:02:15.730 --> 00:02:19.410
<i>we could easily enhance Agastia's 
domination potential.</i>

00:02:19.410 --> 00:02:22.220
We will need to consider our 
response to your offer.

00:02:19.410 --> 00:02:22.910
<b>Absolute Zero Chief of Staff
Megistus</b>

00:02:22.220 --> 00:02:24.300
<i>Surely there's no reason to hesitate.</i>

00:02:24.630 --> 00:02:27.760
<i>It's a fine deal, isn't it?</i>

00:02:27.760 --> 00:02:29.420
We will consider it,

00:02:29.420 --> 00:02:31.910
and contact you again when we're ready.

00:02:31.910 --> 00:02:33.270
<i>Very well...</i>

00:02:33.270 --> 00:02:34.750
<i>I see.</i>

00:02:34.750 --> 00:02:38.740
<i>But do remember that you 
have little time to waste.</i>

00:02:38.740 --> 00:02:40.660
<i>Decisions should be made ASAP.</i>

00:02:40.660 --> 00:02:43.420
<i>That is the global standard.</i>

00:02:44.930 --> 00:02:48.680
<b>Secret Society: Agastia Great Leader
Akashic</b>

00:02:45.300 --> 00:02:48.160
Ugh! What a jerk!

00:02:48.160 --> 00:02:49.600
Thinking he can boss us around...

00:02:50.190 --> 00:02:54.430
It is common enough for companies
 to think that their capital

00:02:54.430 --> 00:02:56.850
should be synonymous with their influence.

00:02:56.850 --> 00:02:59.930
But what is your decision, Great Leader?

00:03:00.190 --> 00:03:03.210
They're requiring no restructuring 
of our executive level or below.

00:03:03.210 --> 00:03:07.140
We'll receive more funding, and our 
compensation will greatly improve.

00:03:11.450 --> 00:03:14.650
<i>World domination is about safety in size!</i>

00:03:12.790 --> 00:03:15.810
The foreign investor, 
Secret Society: Zet Arc...

00:03:14.650 --> 00:03:17.680
<i>All of our affiliate companies 
see rapid growth!</i>

00:03:16.390 --> 00:03:19.080
Those worldwide players really have it good.

00:03:17.680 --> 00:03:20.110
<i>Zet Arc will repaint the whole world!</i>

00:03:19.550 --> 00:03:23.610
It appears Zet Arc is interested in 
direct expansion into the Asia region.

00:03:20.570 --> 00:03:23.600
<i>Zet Arc will repaint the whole world!</i>

00:03:24.800 --> 00:03:27.950
But doesn't M&A among evil secret 
societies seem a little...

00:03:27.950 --> 00:03:29.750
M&A?

00:03:29.750 --> 00:03:32.200
Mergers and acquisitions.

00:03:32.200 --> 00:03:34.180
It means buying up companies.

00:03:34.180 --> 00:03:39.140
I expect they must want to use us as 
a foothold for expansion into Asia.

00:03:39.870 --> 00:03:43.270
That lab's budget is clearly 
orders of magnitude above ours!

00:03:43.270 --> 00:03:47.360
With something like that, we could do 
all the monster development we wanted!

00:03:47.660 --> 00:03:52.020
But... we can't actually join them, can we?

00:03:54.450 --> 00:03:56.520
But according to Uncle's investigations,

00:03:56.520 --> 00:03:59.860
they're not afraid of strong-arming 
to get their way.

00:04:04.800 --> 00:04:06.760
<b>Specialized Counter-Blade Monster
Mummy</b>

00:04:04.800 --> 00:04:06.760
<b>Chocolate Monster
Melty</b>

00:04:09.260 --> 00:04:11.020
<b>Aladdin Lunches to Go</b>

00:04:09.560 --> 00:04:11.000
Welcome!

00:04:11.330 --> 00:04:12.960
Three orders of pork on rice,

00:04:12.960 --> 00:04:15.520
with two helpings of pickled ginger each.

00:04:15.520 --> 00:04:16.700
<i>And now for our next story.</i>

00:04:17.300 --> 00:04:25.410
<i>Marukari Corporation announced its acquisition
 by foreign investor Amajin Corporation.</i>

00:04:18.270 --> 00:04:21.300
<b>FOREIGN INVESTOR ACQUISITION</b>

00:04:18.270 --> 00:04:21.300
<b>FOREIGN COMPANY BUYS OUT MARUKARI CORPORATION</b>

00:04:18.270 --> 00:04:21.300
<b>FOREIGN COMPANY BUYS 
OUT MARUKARI CORPORATION</b>

00:04:21.300 --> 00:04:25.410
<b>Caution! Flashing lights!</b>

00:04:25.410 --> 00:04:28.430
<i>Hey, that's the company 
we used to make Melty.</i>

00:04:28.920 --> 00:04:32.640
<i>I guess companies don't necessarily 
stay the same forever.</i>

00:04:33.690 --> 00:04:36.880
Mr. Cannon, how do you like today's lunch?

00:04:33.710 --> 00:04:37.170
<b>Re-Regenerated • Regenerating Monster
New • Hydra</b>

00:04:37.160 --> 00:04:39.130
Oh, it's delicious!

00:04:37.170 --> 00:04:40.670
<b>Long-Range Attack Specialized Monster
Cannon Thunderbird</b>

00:04:39.130 --> 00:04:41.170
You're such a great cook, Miss Hydra!

00:04:41.170 --> 00:04:44.420
Incidentally, I've heard there's 
been some talk of M&A!

00:04:44.420 --> 00:04:46.550
Guess Agastia's in big trouble, huh?

00:04:46.550 --> 00:04:48.750
What's an M&A?

00:04:48.750 --> 00:04:50.690
Is it a type of chocolate?

00:04:52.670 --> 00:04:56.210
What kind of question is that?!

00:04:52.670 --> 00:04:56.210
You really try my patience...

00:04:52.670 --> 00:04:56.210
Now I want to eat some chocolate.

00:04:52.670 --> 00:04:56.210
I think he's trying to make Matsu laugh...

00:04:56.860 --> 00:04:59.440
Haven't you done enough, Reo?

00:04:59.440 --> 00:05:00.500
Absolutely not!

00:05:00.500 --> 00:05:02.760
I'm awesome at this! 
I could keep winning all day!

00:05:02.760 --> 00:05:05.100
And you can keep the plushies, Yuto.

00:05:05.100 --> 00:05:06.750
Th-Thanks...

00:05:06.750 --> 00:05:10.450
So you're not actually doing it 
because you want the stuff?

00:05:11.110 --> 00:05:12.400
This sensation...

00:05:12.400 --> 00:05:13.420
A monster?

00:05:14.840 --> 00:05:17.340
I'm not picking up any mana, at least.

00:05:19.490 --> 00:05:20.510
<i>What is that?</i>

00:05:20.510 --> 00:05:23.440
<i>It doesn't feel like one of Agastia's monsters.</i>

00:05:26.840 --> 00:05:28.390
<i>Jaguar Base here!</i>

00:05:28.390 --> 00:05:31.120
<i>We're under attack from an unknown monster!</i>

00:05:31.120 --> 00:05:33.600
<i>I can't get in touch with Lord Jaguar!</i>

00:05:33.600 --> 00:05:35.640
<i>This is the undersea observatory!</i>

00:05:35.640 --> 00:05:38.220
<i>Something has us surrounded!</i>

00:05:38.220 --> 00:05:39.480
<i>Emergency!</i>

00:05:39.480 --> 00:05:43.560
<i>We're getting external interference in 
Lord Eldridge's Philadelphia Plan dimension!</i>

00:05:43.560 --> 00:05:45.590
What's all this, then?

00:05:45.960 --> 00:05:47.470
<i>Isn't it obvious?</i>

00:05:47.470 --> 00:05:50.590
<i>We're attacking your executives' bases.</i>

00:05:50.950 --> 00:05:53.300
<i>We are realists, you see.</i>

00:05:53.300 --> 00:05:57.700
<i>We wish to drive seizure of your 
assets in a thoroughly agile manner.</i>

00:05:57.700 --> 00:06:02.340
Oh? I don't recall giving you our answer yet.

00:06:02.340 --> 00:06:04.430
<i>If I might rephrase more simply,</i>

00:06:04.430 --> 00:06:07.500
<i>we have rescinded, from you, 
the element of choice.</i>

00:06:07.920 --> 00:06:10.150
<i>It's time to accept what's happening.</i>

00:06:10.150 --> 00:06:13.160
Would this be a hostile takeover, then?

00:06:13.160 --> 00:06:15.670
In other words, an invasion.

00:06:16.010 --> 00:06:18.440
<i>You exaggerate, surely.</i>

00:06:18.440 --> 00:06:20.410
<i>I simply thought I'd show 
a minor organization</i>

00:06:20.410 --> 00:06:23.630
<i>that has failed to control even 
this small area after so long</i>

00:06:23.630 --> 00:06:27.440
<i>what true power looks like.</i>

00:06:40.380 --> 00:06:41.980
Get out of here, everyone!

00:06:41.980 --> 00:06:44.620
The emergency exits are this way! Hurry!

00:06:50.380 --> 00:06:52.380
Bete Claw!

00:06:52.700 --> 00:06:54.130
What's with these things?

00:06:54.130 --> 00:06:55.770
Are they machines or something?!

00:06:59.510 --> 00:07:00.860
This is...

00:07:00.860 --> 00:07:04.020
There are monsters integrated 
into the machinery.

00:07:04.020 --> 00:07:06.070
They must take the monsters 
from the companies they buy,

00:07:06.070 --> 00:07:07.650
alter them to their company standard,

00:07:07.650 --> 00:07:09.520
and force them to work against their will.

00:07:09.520 --> 00:07:11.670
Ignoring the will of the monsters, huh?

00:07:11.670 --> 00:07:13.280
That's nuts!

00:07:14.100 --> 00:07:16.240
As an evil organization ourselves,

00:07:16.240 --> 00:07:18.950
we're in no position to object to the practice.

00:07:18.950 --> 00:07:22.120
But I still don't like their methods!

00:07:22.120 --> 00:07:23.090
Yeah.

00:07:26.010 --> 00:07:27.620
Miss Kuroitsu?

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:31.430
MASS PRODUCTION MONSTER

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:31.430
m 54 110 l 56 176 124 176 203 169 215 150 213 110

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:31.430
Zet Arc's monster. Can be swiftly mass-produced to a 
unified standard. With the versatility to perform any task 
and the ability to mindlessly receive orders, they are 
rumored to be the future of mass-produced monsters 
in the world marketplace.

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:31.430
SPECIAL ABILITIES

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:31.430
m 60 203 l 59 225 193 226 224 213 218 202

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:31.430
UNKNOWN

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:31.430
POWER

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:31.430
SPEED

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:31.430
ENDURANCE

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:31.430
COST
PERFORMANCE

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:31.430
INTELLIGENCE

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:31.430
TECHNIQUE

00:07:47.680 --> 00:07:50.230
I'll back you up, Mr. Cannon!

00:07:50.230 --> 00:07:51.640
Fall back, everyone!

00:07:51.640 --> 00:07:55.250
Lightning-calling system, 
Great Spirit, activate!

00:07:59.760 --> 00:08:01.110
You did it!

00:08:02.730 --> 00:08:03.860
But...

00:08:04.280 --> 00:08:05.950
We're not even making a dent!

00:08:08.080 --> 00:08:09.240
Reinforcements!

00:08:09.240 --> 00:08:11.210
How can there be more of the darn things?!

00:08:11.210 --> 00:08:14.760
Did you think I'd fail to evaluate 
your combat ability correctly?

00:08:16.270 --> 00:08:20.760
I've prepared exactly what I require to win.

00:08:21.030 --> 00:08:23.380
You're a Zet Arc executive, then?

00:08:23.380 --> 00:08:26.900
I am Zet Acht, soon to be your superior.

00:08:26.900 --> 00:08:29.260
I would advise you to put an end 
to this pointless resistance.

00:08:29.260 --> 00:08:31.940
It could affect your post-merger assessment.

00:08:31.940 --> 00:08:34.020
There's no guarantee that 
there will be a merger!

00:08:34.270 --> 00:08:37.400
What would a mere employee know?

00:08:37.800 --> 00:08:40.540
Go, Z Killer Army!

00:08:40.540 --> 00:08:43.060
Dispose of any who stand against us!

00:08:43.060 --> 00:08:45.160
There's always more where you came from!

00:08:45.670 --> 00:08:51.190
Zet Arc is ranked number one among 
prospective monster employers!

00:08:58.850 --> 00:09:00.010
What?!

00:09:03.800 --> 00:09:05.350
We made it, mew!

00:09:05.350 --> 00:09:08.500
Secret Society: Black Lore has arrived, mew!

00:09:08.760 --> 00:09:12.230
And I'm the only one allowed 
to touch my precious Wolfie!

00:09:12.230 --> 00:09:15.460
You're the last one I want 
touchin' me, you perv cat!

00:09:17.000 --> 00:09:19.070
Magia Full Break!

00:09:23.900 --> 00:09:26.330
We heard the story, Agastia!

00:09:26.330 --> 00:09:28.320
We'll let you off this time,

00:09:28.320 --> 00:09:31.410
but this is just professional, 
so don't go getting the wrong idea!

00:09:31.410 --> 00:09:34.040
You didn't have to announce all that...

00:09:34.290 --> 00:09:36.100
We're joining the fight!

00:09:36.100 --> 00:09:38.720
Let's work together to get rid of these guys!

00:09:39.860 --> 00:09:41.560
Strike Rose!

00:09:41.950 --> 00:09:45.050
Sword Zwart Flash!

00:09:46.140 --> 00:09:47.280
Impossible...

00:09:47.610 --> 00:09:51.320
According to my research, 
they're supposed to be enemies.

00:09:51.320 --> 00:09:53.670
And we are still enemies!

00:09:53.670 --> 00:09:56.570
But what matters is, none of us 
like having you people here!

00:09:56.570 --> 00:09:58.920
Power plays are so last decade, mew!

00:09:58.920 --> 00:10:00.960
Go on back home already, mew!

00:10:01.210 --> 00:10:03.500
It appears I miscalculated.

00:10:03.500 --> 00:10:04.790
Goodness me.

00:10:10.320 --> 00:10:13.400
To take the field myself 
is terribly inefficient.

00:10:13.400 --> 00:10:17.520
I'll have to reflect on this later.

00:10:17.970 --> 00:10:20.330
A battle form! It can't be...

00:10:20.330 --> 00:10:22.830
You leave me no choice. 
I'll engage you myself.

00:10:22.830 --> 00:10:23.980
Run, everyone!

00:10:37.210 --> 00:10:39.270
He's blastin' through his own allies!

00:10:39.270 --> 00:10:41.230
He's... so strong.

00:10:41.230 --> 00:10:43.230
What powerful equipment...

00:10:43.230 --> 00:10:46.750
Foreign investors really do have 
it good with their R&D scale!

00:10:46.750 --> 00:10:47.860
Of course we do.

00:10:47.860 --> 00:10:50.820
My annual income is 12 million dollars.

00:10:50.820 --> 00:10:54.770
We operate on a different scale than your
 little island nation's "major corporations."

00:10:55.040 --> 00:10:56.730
Damn it! This ain't over yet!

00:10:56.730 --> 00:10:58.580
I'll use my full-power Bete Claw!

00:11:00.930 --> 00:11:02.000
What?!

00:11:07.670 --> 00:11:08.940
Wolfie boy!

00:11:08.940 --> 00:11:11.190
Don't you hurt my Wolfie!

00:11:22.920 --> 00:11:24.590
Utterly pathetic.

00:11:24.590 --> 00:11:31.670
And for your information, my engagement 
with you is not merely a waste of time.

00:11:31.950 --> 00:11:33.010
Don't tell me...

00:11:33.010 --> 00:11:35.970
I have flying columns deployed.

00:11:35.970 --> 00:11:38.410
By now, they'll have destroyed 
your major facilities,

00:11:38.410 --> 00:11:39.950
taken the country in their grasp,

00:11:39.950 --> 00:11:42.010
and are heading our way.

00:11:48.890 --> 00:11:50.930
It appears that this is over.

00:12:02.350 --> 00:12:05.080
I can see we've disappointed you.

00:12:05.080 --> 00:12:09.030
You should realize we wouldn't 
be sitting idly by for all this time.

00:12:09.710 --> 00:12:12.370
Absolute Zero Chief of Staff Megistus!

00:12:18.850 --> 00:12:21.250
I've used up the area's 
low pressure system.

00:12:21.250 --> 00:12:23.280
There's no electricity left!

00:12:23.700 --> 00:12:26.140
Miss Hydra, you have to get out of here!

00:12:26.140 --> 00:12:28.610
No! I'll stay with you to the end!

00:12:33.350 --> 00:12:34.500
What?!

00:12:34.500 --> 00:12:36.270
That attack looks like...

00:12:40.370 --> 00:12:43.030
How dare you abuse my subordinates?

00:12:43.030 --> 00:12:45.270
Great Leader Akashic!

00:12:52.220 --> 00:12:54.040
Sorry to arrive late.

00:12:58.780 --> 00:13:03.470
I'm not fond of being called 
out of retirement like this...

00:13:03.470 --> 00:13:07.550
But when justice calls, 
you can't turn it down!

00:13:09.310 --> 00:13:12.170
They destroyed our main fighting force?!

00:13:12.170 --> 00:13:13.460
Of course we did.

00:13:13.820 --> 00:13:17.460
Don't underestimate the 
members of the board.

00:13:17.460 --> 00:13:18.790
No matter...

00:13:18.790 --> 00:13:20.730
Once the country is in my hands,

00:13:20.730 --> 00:13:23.600
it will be but a matter of 
time before your base falls.

00:13:23.600 --> 00:13:27.650
You don't have the personnel 
to protect the entire country.

00:13:27.650 --> 00:13:28.850
Oh?

00:13:28.850 --> 00:13:32.970
It appears Zet Arc's information 
network has its limitations.

00:13:32.970 --> 00:13:33.830
What's that?

00:13:34.200 --> 00:13:36.940
Behold this country's true power!

00:13:42.970 --> 00:13:47.410
Never thought I'd be fighting 
alongside you, Ibaliger!

00:13:47.960 --> 00:13:50.080
To defend the peace of Ibaraki,

00:13:50.080 --> 00:13:53.110
I'll travel through space 
and time, and fight!

00:13:54.100 --> 00:13:55.180
Heck yeah!

00:13:55.180 --> 00:13:58.110
I'll smash up anyone who comes after Chiba!

00:14:00.850 --> 00:14:02.240
Sounds like fun!

00:14:02.240 --> 00:14:03.130
Yatsurugi!

00:14:03.130 --> 00:14:05.230
I'll work with you just this once!

00:14:07.260 --> 00:14:11.490
I'll put an end to your wretched greed!

00:14:12.990 --> 00:14:16.350
Niigata is our sacred land!

00:14:16.350 --> 00:14:18.380
You won't leave here alive!

00:14:18.630 --> 00:14:22.130
Ah, well, guess it's a living!

00:14:22.130 --> 00:14:25.580
You wanna finish this up quick, Neiger?

00:14:27.350 --> 00:14:31.280
You won't get your hands on Akita!

00:14:37.540 --> 00:14:39.640
Those who go against the will of darkness,

00:14:39.640 --> 00:14:41.940
whoever they are, must be purged.

00:14:42.750 --> 00:14:46.310
You'll regret that you encountered me...

00:14:46.930 --> 00:14:48.190
here in Hokkaido!

00:14:50.700 --> 00:14:53.390
The Edo River will see 
another day of profits!

00:14:55.610 --> 00:14:59.180
I'll close down your business for good!

00:15:01.500 --> 00:15:06.900
You're an eyesore in 
Tokushima's beautiful lands!

00:15:09.440 --> 00:15:12.970
Mavel will put an end to your wicked hearts!

00:15:15.220 --> 00:15:16.970
Let's go, Toshimach!

00:15:17.400 --> 00:15:18.900
We'll settle this at mach speed!

00:15:18.900 --> 00:15:20.170
Better get ready!

00:15:20.470 --> 00:15:22.900
What fools you are,
ignorantly impinging on

00:15:23.430 --> 00:15:25.370
our Toshima Ward turf!

00:15:25.870 --> 00:15:28.160
The minor local societies...

00:15:28.160 --> 00:15:29.550
And their heroes, too!

00:15:29.550 --> 00:15:32.490
Our company policies are flexible!

00:15:32.490 --> 00:15:38.000
If the need arises, we will strategically 
coordinate even with rival organizations!

00:15:39.370 --> 00:15:43.290
Hello? Is this Secret Society of Evil, Inc?

00:15:43.800 --> 00:15:45.260
Yes, Matsuyama speaking.

00:15:45.260 --> 00:15:47.250
Thanks so much for having 
us by the other day.

00:15:47.250 --> 00:15:49.260
We have a proposal for you.

00:15:50.050 --> 00:15:52.000
Dice and Dharuriser are in!

00:15:52.610 --> 00:15:56.640
Okay! We're calling in every 
old work connection we have!

00:15:56.640 --> 00:15:59.030
Let's bring enemy and ally together!

00:15:59.030 --> 00:16:00.010
Right!

00:16:00.010 --> 00:16:03.520
Consider Kyushu protected!

00:16:03.760 --> 00:16:07.700
Though we're the ones actually 
doing the protecting!

00:16:11.030 --> 00:16:12.470
Yes, indeed.

00:16:19.950 --> 00:16:21.960
We'll get up as many times as it takes.

00:16:21.960 --> 00:16:25.220
As long as we get up, we'll never lose!

00:16:29.600 --> 00:16:32.260
Perfect way to shake off a hangover.

00:16:32.650 --> 00:16:35.840
I was just hopin' for a little action!

00:16:35.840 --> 00:16:38.710
Step forward if you want to die.

00:16:38.710 --> 00:16:41.330
I'll grind 'em to powder!

00:16:50.350 --> 00:16:52.130
I finally made it!

00:16:52.130 --> 00:16:53.870
Divine Swordsman Blader!

00:16:53.870 --> 00:16:57.980
You're the only one left, Zet Acht! 
Time to get what's coming to you!

00:16:58.940 --> 00:17:02.140
Watch your mouth, you pathetic heroes!

00:17:02.140 --> 00:17:06.240
It's a trivial matter to regrow 
those cannon fodder monsters!

00:17:06.470 --> 00:17:10.380
In the meantime, I'll 
annihilate you all myself!

00:17:10.380 --> 00:17:13.080
Feel the blade of justice!

00:17:14.100 --> 00:17:17.010
Blader Crush!

00:17:19.350 --> 00:17:20.330
What?!

00:17:23.500 --> 00:17:24.680
Blader!

00:17:25.110 --> 00:17:27.890
You think too highly of yourself, brat.

00:17:29.620 --> 00:17:31.040
Who's next?

00:17:35.470 --> 00:17:38.330
Any who remain standing are my enemy.

00:17:38.330 --> 00:17:40.500
I won't show an ounce of mercy.

00:17:41.330 --> 00:17:42.580
This ends now!

00:17:43.340 --> 00:17:44.330
Doctor!

00:17:44.330 --> 00:17:47.760
I managed to finish your 
research, Miss Kuroitsu!

00:17:48.120 --> 00:17:50.280
Thanks to Miss Hoen's help!

00:17:50.570 --> 00:17:54.280
I d-d-didn't do it for you, Sadamaki!

00:17:54.280 --> 00:17:56.740
Save the romcom junk for later, mew.

00:17:56.740 --> 00:17:59.560
If you brought somethin' useful, 
whip it out already, mew.

00:17:59.820 --> 00:18:01.820
Take it, Wolf!

00:18:04.680 --> 00:18:06.770
Yes! This time...

00:18:08.440 --> 00:18:09.890
Wolfie boy!

00:18:09.890 --> 00:18:11.250
You can't handle it, mew.

00:18:11.250 --> 00:18:13.180
You're hurt way too bad, mew.

00:18:14.210 --> 00:18:16.410
If I don't do it...

00:18:17.240 --> 00:18:18.130
No.

00:18:19.240 --> 00:18:20.840
I'm here, too.

00:18:20.840 --> 00:18:22.860
Don't do it, Miss Kuroitsu!

00:18:22.860 --> 00:18:25.210
It might explode again!

00:18:25.640 --> 00:18:26.900
That's all right.

00:18:26.900 --> 00:18:29.080
I trust the doctor and Miss Hoen.

00:18:29.520 --> 00:18:34.200
This item is itself a monster whose form will
 change based on the monster that equips it.

00:18:35.230 --> 00:18:37.750
Humans should be able to equip it, too.

00:18:40.510 --> 00:18:43.550
We'll finish things between 
us later, Agastia.

00:18:43.550 --> 00:18:44.950
For now, let's...

00:18:44.950 --> 00:18:46.440
...beat this guy.

00:18:46.440 --> 00:18:47.220
Here I go!

00:18:47.430 --> 00:18:49.180
Transform!

00:19:02.990 --> 00:19:04.740
Black Blader!

00:19:06.420 --> 00:19:09.170
<i>Next stage! Master Blader!</i>

00:19:12.080 --> 00:19:13.610
Master Blade!

00:19:15.770 --> 00:19:17.350
Black Blade!

00:19:38.810 --> 00:19:40.110
How...

00:19:40.110 --> 00:19:42.320
Th-This is so... inefficient...

00:19:42.320 --> 00:19:45.170
You can't make a monster like this!

00:19:46.420 --> 00:19:48.960
Don't underestimate the one-off monster!

00:19:48.960 --> 00:19:52.330
Monster development has 
infinite possibilities!

00:19:52.330 --> 00:19:56.090
You minor organizations... 
have no possibilities...

00:19:56.090 --> 00:19:58.600
Take this, Black Blader!

00:20:03.310 --> 00:20:05.180
We'll give you...

00:20:05.180 --> 00:20:06.880
...our power, too!

00:20:18.360 --> 00:20:21.650
Double Blader Crush!

00:20:25.800 --> 00:20:30.090
Impossible!

00:20:30.740 --> 00:20:31.700
Yes!

00:20:31.700 --> 00:20:32.990
We won, mew!

00:20:33.640 --> 00:20:35.320
It worked...

00:20:46.010 --> 00:20:49.120
No matter how much capital you have...

00:20:49.120 --> 00:20:52.170
In the end, it all comes down to people.

00:21:02.600 --> 00:21:06.310
All right. Time to transform back...

00:21:07.780 --> 00:21:08.650
Huh?

00:21:09.090 --> 00:21:10.020
Why...

00:21:10.720 --> 00:21:11.750
I can't take it off!

00:21:11.750 --> 00:21:12.950
I take it off?!

00:21:12.950 --> 00:21:13.780
What do I do?

00:21:14.150 --> 00:21:15.300
Blader!

00:21:16.110 --> 00:21:18.320
Does it seem like the joint 
in the back is stuck?

00:21:18.650 --> 00:21:20.020
Could you take it off for me?

00:21:20.020 --> 00:21:21.540
S-Sure...

00:21:24.010 --> 00:21:25.720
<i>Take off...</i>

00:21:27.840 --> 00:21:30.810
<i>Take off... a woman's...</i>

00:21:32.730 --> 00:21:35.460
<i>Divine Swordsman Blader, 
Kenji Sadamaki, at 22 years old,</i>

00:21:35.460 --> 00:21:38.070
<i>was highly vulnerable to the female form.</i>

00:21:40.050 --> 00:21:42.070
<i>I'm sorry to interrupt.</i>

00:21:42.070 --> 00:21:44.720
<i>My name is Black Blader.</i>

00:21:46.110 --> 00:21:48.340
<i>I sincerely apologize for the inconvenience,</i>

00:21:48.340 --> 00:21:52.010
<i>but the transformation reversal function 
will only be available in tomorrow's update.</i>

00:21:52.460 --> 00:21:54.640
Hang on, are you telling me...

00:21:55.140 --> 00:21:56.210
I'm sorry!

00:21:58.640 --> 00:22:02.310
We'll try... to do the update quick.

00:22:42.370 --> 00:22:45.230
It's quintessential spaghetti code.

00:22:45.540 --> 00:22:48.750
How did our program end up this janky?

00:22:49.620 --> 00:22:52.450
What do you expect? 
We were kind of in a hurry!

00:22:52.450 --> 00:22:54.520
It's frankly a miracle 
that it's working at all!

00:22:54.520 --> 00:22:59.940
The execution is wild... I can't 
keep up with all the bugs.

00:22:59.940 --> 00:23:03.010
I really wish I'd transformed instead.

00:23:03.010 --> 00:23:04.830
<i>I'm terribly sorry.</i>

00:23:04.830 --> 00:23:07.300
<i>But my life support functions 
are in perfect working order,</i>

00:23:07.300 --> 00:23:08.400
<i>so please be at ease.</i>

00:23:08.400 --> 00:23:11.790
Would you just do something 
about this already?!

00:23:12.280 --> 00:23:14.280
<b>Aladdin Lunches to Go</b>

00:23:15.590 --> 00:23:17.110
Welco—

00:23:26.650 --> 00:23:28.090
Four orders of pork on rice,

00:23:28.090 --> 00:23:30.570
with two helpings of pickled ginger each.
